<title>USA: Urban Shopping mall to include Sears.</title>
<headline>Urban Shopping mall to include Sears.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Shopping Centers Inc said Monday that a Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co full-line, two-level store and a detached, eight-bay Sears Automotive Center will be part of the new Citrus Mall in Tampa, Fla.</p>
<p>The new 1.2 million square foot regional mall is scheduled to open in the spring of 1999.</p>
<p>Urban Shopping, a self-administered real estate investment trust, manages about 55 million square feet of space in 27 states and the District of Columbia.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
